WEBVTT

00:00:00.471 --> 00:00:01.140
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:02.153 --> 00:00:05.440
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> Have you ever <b>tried to learn</b> something new and failed?

00:00:07.452 --> 00:00:08.086
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:09.180 --> 00:00:12.157
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> How important is it to know <b>how to drive</b>?

00:00:14.321 --> 00:00:15.024
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:16.068 --> 00:00:20.213
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> How long do you usually spend deciding <b>what to wear</b> in the morning?

00:00:22.276 --> 00:00:23.013
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:24.042 --> 00:00:27.576
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> Have you ever <b>forgotten to turn off</b> your phone during a class or concert?

00:00:29.740 --> 00:00:30.597
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:31.595 --> 00:00:33.892
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> Where are you <b>hoping to go</b> for your next holiday?

00:00:35.836 --> 00:00:36.745
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

00:00:37.776 --> 00:00:39.721
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> Are you <b>planning to go anywhere</b> next weekend?

00:00:41.783 --> 00:00:42.532
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 7

00:00:43.620 --> 00:00:46.310
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> Would you like <b>to work or study</b> in another country?

00:00:48.390 --> 00:00:48.980
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 8

00:00:50.029 --> 00:00:53.059
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> Have you ever <b>pretended to be ill</b> when you weren’t?

00:00:55.087 --> 00:00:55.849
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 9

00:00:56.819 --> 00:00:59.667
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> Do you think it’s important <b>to learn to cook</b> at school?

00:01:01.684 --> 00:01:02.298
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 10

00:01:03.451 --> 00:01:07.458
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> Do you think it’s possible <b>to stay friends</b> with an ex-boyfriend or girlfriend?